            "paragraphs": [
                {
                    "context": "The H3RO Esports 5.0 was an online Mobile Legends: Bang Bang tournament held from May 13 to May 26, 2024, in Indonesia. Organized by H3RO and sponsored by Tri Indonesia, the event featured 16 teams competing for a prize pool of Rp300,000,000 IDR (approximately $18,700 USD). The tournament had a group stage from May 13 to 16 and a playoff from May 22 to 26. The final match was a Best-of-Seven (Bo7). Fnatic ONIC won first place with Rp110,000,000 IDR in prize money. EVOS Holy secured second place, and Alter Ego finished third.",
